# ==============================================================================
# AI DeskMate — Environment Configuration Example (.env.example)
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: AI DeskMate is a 100% offline, privacy-first desktop application.
# It does NOT require any external cloud API keys or telemetry tokens.
# All environment variables listed below are OPTIONAL overrides.
#
# To use: Copy this file to '.env' and adjust the values as needed.
# ==============================================================================

# Custom Data Directory (Default: %APPDATA%/AI DeskMate on Windows)
# Useful for portable installations or isolating test data:
# DESKMATE_DATA_DIR=./data

# Run in Demo Mode (1 = Use 4-week synthetic dataset and pre-trained demo model)
# DESKMATE_DEMO_MODE=0

# Streamlit Analytics Dashboard Port (Default: Automatically finds a free port)
# DESKMATE_PORT=8501

